<li><strong>50GB (&#36;0.99/month):</strong> Standard limit</li><br/>
<li><strong>200GB (&#36;2.99/month):</strong> Up to 2× the standard limit</li><br/>
<li><strong>2TB (&#36;9.99/month):</strong> Up to 5×</li><br/>
<li><strong>6TB (&#36;29.99/month):</strong> Up to 10×</li><br/>
